; beancount's printer leaves a directive's filename and lineno out of its
; metadata, as it holds its position there, whatever a directive writes
; under those keys. Each directive is alone on its date, as beancount sorts
; a directive among those of its date by the lineno it writes.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
  filename: "accounts.beancount"
  note: "kept"
2020-01-02 open Assets:B

2020-01-03 * "a transaction's own filename and lineno"
  filename: "statement.pdf"
  lineno: 7
  source: "bank"
  Assets:A  1 USD
  Assets:B
